  "content": "<p>為附魔物品添加紫色高光效果，如下圖所示：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1222/766/2025-06-17_01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"435\"></p><p>本模組靈感來自 Actions &amp; stuff (Oreville Studios)</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%252foreville-studios%252factions--stuff-1.4%252f61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.minecraft.net/en-us/marketplace/pdp/oreville-studios/actions--stuff-1.4/61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>目前支援的物品：</p><p>-劍<br>-鎬<br>-斧<br>-鏟<br>-鋤<br>-弓<br>-弩<br>-盾牌<br>-釣竿(附魔胡蘿蔔釣竿與扭曲菌釣竿)<br>-剪刀<br>-打火石<br>-頭盔(含海龜殼)(僅物品形態)<br>-胸甲(僅物品形態)<br>-護腿(僅物品形態)<br>-靴子(僅物品形態)<br>-附魔書(與成書)<br>-附魔金蘋果<br>-磁石指南針<br>-經驗瓶<br>-地獄之星<br>-錘<br>-三叉戟(投擲時無效)<br>-終界水晶<br>-考古刷</p><p>部分支援物品<br>-穿著中的盔甲(需透過respackopts啟用，預設關閉)<br>此功能尚存BUG，仍在開發中<br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/jkvjEM8B/images/ee4aeda296ebaadd8754ebfb61655b0cac3790e4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"527\" height=\"793\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>其他選項(需搭配respackopts模組)：</p><p>-可切換附魔光效顏色</p><p>-支援Vanilla tweaks(3D戰錘、盾牌下移、工具磨損、經驗瓶飛濺、金皇冠) -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252fpicker%252fresource-packs%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p><p>-支援Fresh Food -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffresh-food\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p><p>-支援Even Better Enchants -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252feven-better-enchants\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p><p>-支援Realistic Mace 3D -&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252freal-mace\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">感謝dbrighthd製作盔甲光效</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fdbrighthd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/user/dbrighthd</a></span></strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感謝Aurora-1-2-3負責3D戰錘與盾牌下移功能</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252faurora-1-2-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/user/aurora-1-2-3</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>核心著色器由Tixork製作<br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ftixork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/user/tixork</a><br><br></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感謝Vanilla Tweaks團隊提供z-fighting修復方案</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://vanillatweaks.net/</a></strong></span></p>",
